{"verse_key": "10:81", "surah": 10, "verse": 81, "text_uthmani": "فَلَمَّآ أَلْقَوْا۟ قَالَ مُوسَىٰ مَا جِئْتُم بِهِ ٱلسِّحْرُ ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ سَيُبْطِلُهُۥٓ ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يُصْلِحُ عَمَلَ ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ", "translation": "And when they had thrown, Moses said, \"What you have brought is [only] magic. Indeed, Allāh will expose its worthlessness. Indeed, Allāh does not amend the work of corrupters.", "verse_from_ms": 1786840, "verse_to_ms": 1805540, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "فَلَمَّآ", "start_ms": 1786840, "end_ms": 1789330}, {"i": 1, "text": "أَلْقَوْا۟", "start_ms": 1789330, "end_ms": 1790210}, {"i": 2, "text": "قَالَ", "start_ms": 1790210, "end_ms": 1790770}, {"i": 3, "text": "مُوسَىٰ", "start_ms": 1790770, "end_ms": 1791520}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 1791520, "end_ms": 1791890}, {"i": 5, "text": "جِئْتُم", "start_ms": 1791890, "end_ms": 1793180}, {"i": 6, "text": "بِهِ", "start_ms": 1793180, "end_ms": 1793490}, {"i": 7, "text": "ٱلسِّحْرُ", "start_ms": 1793490, "end_ms": 1794270}, {"i": 8, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1794270, "end_ms": 1795210}, {"i": 9, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1795210, "end_ms": 1796020}, {"i": 10, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 1796020, "end_ms": 1798680}, {"i": 11, "text": "سَيُبْطِلُهُۥٓ", "start_ms": 1798680, "end_ms": 1799860}, {"i": 12, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 1799860, "end_ms": 1800720}, {"i": 13, "text": "إِنَّ", "start_ms": 1800720, "end_ms": 1801070}, {"i": 14, "text": "ٱللَّهَ", "start_ms": 1801070, "end_ms": 1801820}, {"i": 15, "text": "لَا", "start_ms": 1801820, "end_ms": 1802400}, {"i": 16, "text": "يُصْلِحُ", "start_ms": 1802400, "end_ms": 1804985}, {"i": 17, "text": "عَمَلَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}, {"i": 18, "text": "ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ", "start_ms": null, "end_ms": null}]}